        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by the presence of major features of both blepharophimosis-intellectual disability syndrome and genitopatellar syndrome. These major features may include blepharophimosis ptosis hypomimia skeletal features like patellar a/hypoplasia and renal and/or genital malformations."
        },
